# `getschema` returns one row per column: `ColumnName`, `ColumnOrdinal`, `DataType`.
mode: check
show: schema
schema: 'orders.csv'(orderId: string, customerId: string, amount: real, qty: long, timestamp: datetime)
---- query
from 'orders.csv' | getschema
---- expected
query 1 columns:
  ColumnName: string
  ColumnOrdinal: long
  DataType: string
